{"id":"n66633-1-9","stage":4,"title":"쏜살같이 · 飞箭般的","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66633-1-9-1","ko":"방금 여기 도망치던 사람 못 봤습니까?","zh":"您刚才没看到有个人从这里跑过吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도망치던","meaning":"逃跑，逃亡","explanation":"도망치다：逃跑，逃亡；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"도망치다","audio":"/audio/eba9ed68509b1aadd864.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14392","senseId":"1","lemma":"도망치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤습니까?","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"eba9ed685